WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:03.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
-These films obviously
are known for their singing,

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:04.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
for the vocal chops
you guys all bring to it.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:07.674
But you now are,
to some degree, an action star.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.009 line:92%
You had to do multiple stunts.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:11.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Seth, I'm glad
you brought this up,

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:12.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Yeah.

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:15.949
Because, yeah,
Fat Amy mysteriously turns into

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:18.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
an action hero in this film.
-Uh-huh.

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:20.420
-And, luckily,
I do have a bit of a background

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
in martial arts and karate.
-All right.

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:23.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So if I need to,
I can just...

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How far into the karate world
did you get?

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:26.760 align:start size:94% position:6%
Pssh!
-Oh, yeah, you're very good.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like --
-I'm not an expert,

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:29.763 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I can tell,
you're very good.

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:30.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like, yeah.
Yeah, yeah, okay.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:33.566
-Can you do that one more time?
Because that's -- that's wow.

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Look at that reach.
-Yeah.

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:38.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I have both legs.
-If a ninja made the mistake

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.440
of getting his head right there,
good night.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:44.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. That's how
you get the little ninjas.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.079 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:48.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
It was so much fun.

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:50.250 line:92%
Like, I did my own stunts.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I fight off
a lot of bad guys in the film,

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:55.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the rest of the Bellas
get kidnapped.

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:56.056 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And it was really cool.

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:58.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
While some of the other girls
were doing dancing stuff,

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:01.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was doing, like,
hard-core action training.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:04.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, yeah,
I can really throw down.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:05.565 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:06.199 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-So, I don't know.

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:07.500 size:75% position:38%
If anything happens,
like, we're trying

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.402
to get out of the studio safely
or something...

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:11.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, you could be the one
to take the lead.

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:13.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I will take the lead
in the fighting.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:16.576 size:75% position:38%
You stand behind me,
and I'd just like --

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:17.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
Pch-chu-chu!
You know?

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:20.713
I also do my own sound effects.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:23.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Very helpful in a fight.
-Hyah!

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.984 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Yeah. But I actually --

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:25.685 line:92%
The scariest stunt I did.

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:30.623
I did a 20-foot free-fall jump
with my co-star, Anna Kendrick.

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:31.691 line:92%
I know, it sounds mental.

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:34.727
Even when we finished the stunt,
the stunt team were like,

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:39.599
"Oh, uh, no actress we know
would actually do that."

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:40.333 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:43.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we're like,
"Why didn't you tell us that?"

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:45.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because I know
I seem really tough,

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:47.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I am afraid of heights.
-Yeah.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.875 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's the one thing
I'm afraid of.

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:51.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I had to do
this 20-foot jump.

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:52.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just once, hopefully.
-10 times.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:54.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
-10 times!
-10 times with Anna Kendrick.

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:57.951
And each time, petrified,
thought I was gonna die.

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:01.254
And so, the lovely Anna Kendrick
sang to me.

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:03.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, each time
we were hoisted up,

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:06.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
she would sing random stuff
to distract me

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:07.026 line:92%
and try to make me laugh.

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:09.562
Like, she was singing a lot
of Bette Midler classics.

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:10.763 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
She was like
♪♪ Going to the chapel ♪♪

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:16.236 line:92%
♪♪ And we're gonna get married ♪♪

00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:18.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'd be like,
"Keep singing, keep singing."

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:19.472 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:21.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
So that was
a very special memory of mine.

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:22.709 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Well, that's fantastic.

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:25.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's such
a special set of films.

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
Congratulations
on being part of it.

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:28.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we're very excited.
The soundtrack,

00:02:28.882 --> 00:02:31.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is fantastic,
everyone here is gonna be

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:32.952 size:84% position:42%
leaving with it tonight
as a Christmas gift.

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:33.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yes!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:37.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
Courtesy of Rebel.
Rebel Wilson!

